STYLE AND CODE: the look and the story come from a HyperFrames music-video sample made by the library's author (its v001 and
  v002 cuts); the film here is rebuilt on the library's page contract with ../kit/: no HyperFrames, no GSAP.
  ../kit/page/tween.js comes from Game Launch's tween.js (same library), with set, repeat + yoyo, keyframes, colours, SVG
  attributes and number tracks added.

TOOLS: the NEO-Cine library's core/ tools, which are Lemo-Opuscar's (MIT, (c) 2026 SecondFirst Pty Ltd, trading as LemoLab):
